course: dictionary
lesson: 2550
title: Defrost in context
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Defrost means to let something frozen become unfrozen, or to remove the ice from something. Its clues are in the words around it. «Defrost the chicken in the fridge» tells you what you do to the food and where you do it.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. «Unfreeze the chicken in the fridge» still makes sense, so defrost means unfreeze here. The fridge is a clue too: it keeps the food cold while it thaws.
explain: The same word can mean a different action in a different sentence. «We need to defrost the freezer» means removing the ice from the freezer, not unfreezing food. Look at what the word is joined to to find which meaning fits.
fact: Defrost means to become unfrozen, or to remove ice from something.
fact: «Defrost the windscreen» means remove the ice from a car window before driving.
fact: «The peas will defrost in an hour» means the frozen peas will become unfrozen in an hour.
fact: Frozen meat should be defrosted in the fridge or microwave, not on the kitchen counter.
fact: A freezer stops germs growing but does not kill most of them, so «defrosted meat must still be cooked properly».
exercise: «Defrost the chicken in the fridge.» What does defrost mean here? | *Let the frozen chicken become unfrozen | Wash the chicken in cold water | Cook the chicken until it is brown | Put the chicken in the freezer
exercise: Dad says «We need to defrost the freezer». What is he going to do? | Turn it off and throw it away | Fill it with ice cream | *Remove the ice from it | Make it colder
exercise: Ben says defrost means to cook the food. Is he right? | Yes, cooking is always the first step | Yes, but only for peas | No, it means to freeze again | *No, it means to become unfrozen before cooking
test: «A freezer stops germs growing almost completely but does not kill most of them.» Why must defrosted meat still be cooked properly? | It turns back into ice | It is too cold to eat | Cooking makes it colder | *Some germs may still be alive
test: Where is the safest place to defrost frozen meat? | *In the fridge | In a hot car | On the kitchen counter | Under the bed
exam: Which sentence uses defrost to mean remove ice? | *We need to defrost the freezer. | The peas will defrost in an hour. | Defrost the chicken in the fridge. | Let it defrost before we cook it.
